---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Skill Foundry | Practical Skills Platform"
  description="Skill Foundry helps people understand practical digital skills, learn how tools and workflows work, and create independently."
  canonical="https://hub.skillfoundry-web.workers.dev/about/"
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="about-container">
        <h1 class="about-title">Practical skills. Real understanding. Independent creation.</h1>
        <p class="about-lead">Skill Foundry helps you understand useful digital skills, learn how tools and workflows work, and turn that knowledge into something you can create and apply independently.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-body">
      <div class="about-container">
        <div class="about-content">
          <section class="about-section-block">
            <h2>Why Skill Foundry exists</h2>
            <p>Technology is evolving quickly, bringing new tools, possibilities and ways to work. But having access to powerful tools does not automatically mean knowing how to use them effectively.</p>
            <p>Many people follow tutorials, copy prompts and repeat workflows without understanding the decisions behind them. When something changes or does not work as expected, they can struggle to adapt.</p>
            <p>Skill Foundry exists to bridge that gap by turning useful skills and techniques into clear, practical learning experiences.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section-block">
            <h2>How we help you learn</h2>
            <p>We believe learning should go beyond following instructions. Every workflow should help you build understanding, practise a process and become capable of adapting it.</p>
            <div class="about-learning-steps">
              <div class="about-learning-step">
                <h3>Understand</h3>
                <p>Learn the concepts, tools and techniques behind a process.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="about-learning-step">
                <h3>Execute</h3>
                <p>Follow practical instructions and learn through real examples and projects.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="about-learning-step">
                <h3>Adapt</h3>
                <p>Modify what you have learned to suit your own needs, goals and projects.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section-block">
            <h2>What you’ll find here</h2>
            <p>Skill Foundry is being built as a library of practical tutorials, step-by-step blueprints, prompts, tool guidance and creative workflows.</p>
            <p>The focus is on helping you create, solve problems, improve everyday work and turn ideas into practical results. As the library grows, it will cover more tools, techniques and skill areas that help people stay capable and adaptable.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="about-section-block about-section-last">
            <h2>Our approach to practical learning</h2>
            <p>We aim to make every published resource useful, understandable and actionable. Every published resource is personally tested through actual execution before it is published.</p>
            <p>Instructions are designed to explain the process, not just reproduce an output. The goal is to help you develop skills you can continue using, improving and adapting beyond a single tutorial.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    min-height: 80vh;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-container {
    width: min(740px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about-hero {
    padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 72px) 0 clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line, #1E293B);
    background: transparent;
  }

  .about-title {
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    color: #F8FAFC;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5.5vw, 54px);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    max-width: 740px;
  }

  .about-lead {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 680px;
    color: #94A3B8;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2.2vw, 18px);
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  .about-body {
    padding: 36px 0 40px;
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 34px;
  }

  .about-section-block h2 {
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    color: #F8FAFC;
    font-size: clamp(21px, 3.2vw, 26px);
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.22;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .about-section-block p {
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
    color: #CBD5E1;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.68;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .about-section-block p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .about-learning-steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .about-learning-step h3 {
    margin: 0 0 7px;
    color: #F8FAFC;
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .about-learning-step p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  :global([data-theme="light"]) .about-title,
  :global(html.light-theme) .about-title,
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .about-learning-step h3,
  :global(html.light-theme) .about-learning-step h3 {
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  :global([data-theme="light"]) .about-lead,
  :global(html.light-theme) .about-lead {
    color: #475569;
  }

  :global([data-theme="light"]) .about-section-block h2,
  :global(html.light-theme) .about-section-block h2 {
    color: #0F172A;
  }

  :global([data-theme="light"]) .about-section-block p,
  :global(html.light-theme) .about-section-block p {
    color: #334155;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-container {
      width: min(740px, calc(100% - 32px));
    }

    .about-hero {
      padding: 40px 0 24px;
    }

    .about-body {
      padding: 28px 0 48px;
    }

    .about-content {
      gap: 26px;
    }

    .about-title {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: clamp(27px, 7.2vw, 34px);
      line-height: 1.18;
    }

    .about-section-block h2 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .about-section-block p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .about-learning-steps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 15px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .about-learning-step h3 {
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
  }
</style>
